      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MALCOLM.\nThis is the sergeant\nWho, like a good and hardy soldier, fought\n’Gainst my captivity.—Hail, brave friend!\nSay to the King the knowledge of the broil\nAs thou didst leave it.",
